==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|emblématique|lang=fr}}. See [[emblem]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|ĕmb-lə-mă-tĭk}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Serving as, or relating to a [[symbol]], [[emblem]] or [[illustration]] of a [[type]]
# [[typical|Typical]]; [[representative]].
#* {{quote-news|title=Women’s World Cup 2015: England beaten by France in Group F opener|work={{w|The Guardian}} (London)|date=9 June 2015|url=http://www.theguardian.com/football/2015/jun/09/france-england-womens-world-cup-group-f-match-report
|passage=With Le Sommer withdrawn, France – now with five in midfield – seemed content to hold on for a deceptively narrow win. Such containment tactics can prove high risk but the only threat England could muster was a shot from Aluko which flew high and wide. It seemed entirely '''emblematic''' of their afternoon.}}

